\newlabel{fig:plane}{{S4}{4}{Behavioural $(n_\star , s)$ plane of the double-adaptive model, one column per size $L \in \{30, 90, 128\}$; top row $\chi _{\max }$, bottom row $s_{\rm sep}$; $13 \times 13$ grid, five-point $\eta $ sub-grid, three seeds, panels (a)--(f)}{figure.caption.11}{}}
